{"id": "dev025", "question": "云版知识库存储按什么计量、满额还能编辑分段吗、删文档后为何额度没立刻降？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": "cloud", "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-storage-limit"], "nuggets": [{"text": "存储用量取决于文档产生的向量数量。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "额度满时，编辑分段会被拦截。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "删除后账单用量数字延迟刷新。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "novice", "phrasing": "natural_short", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["cloud/use-dify/knowledge/knowledge-storage-limit"]], "reference_answer": "按文档产生的向量数量计量。满额会拦截编辑分段。删文档后账单用量延迟刷新，资料没有给出固定刷新秒数。", "most_likely_failure": "按文件体积算用量或凭数字未降就断言删除无效。"}
{"id": "dev026", "question": "启动Dify1.17.1前，Weaviate逐级升级时，备份用什么复制选项、总量用哪种查询、失败回退时数据卷怎么办？", "split": "dev", "type": "summary", "unanswerable_category": null, "edition": null, "expected_route": "MULTI", "gold_docs": ["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-server-migration-path"], "nuggets": [{"text": "离线复制备份数据卷时使用cp -a。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "对象总量使用GraphQL的Aggregate查询。", "importance": "vital"}, {"text": "失败回退时还原初始备份的数据卷。", "importance": "vital"}], "persona": "expert", "phrasing": "natural_long", "premise": "indirect", "lexical": "similar", "behavior_group": "multi", "behavior_subtype": "scattered_ordered", "guessable_without_docs": null, "gold_doc_groups": [["self-host/deploy/troubleshooting/weaviate-server-migration-path"]], "reference_answer": "离线备份用cp -a保留数据卷属性；总对象数用GraphQL Aggregate查询，不用分页接口的totalResults。中途失败回退时，除回退镜像外，还必须还原初始数据卷备份，不能让旧镜像直接读新版本写过的卷。", "most_likely_failure": "备份丢权限、拿分页大小当总量，或只退镜像不还原卷。"}
